<div class="r-site" data-r107-page data-family="exchange" data-modules="1,2,3,4,5"><header class="r-intro r-intro--small"><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI</p><h1>Charm exchange community</h1></header><section class="r-info-row"><h2>Another combination</h2><div><p>Find another combination for a charm.</p></div></section><section class="r-info-row"><h2>What the community is for</h2><div><p>A planned space to discuss identifiable charms and their compatible bases. Private exchanges are separate from SUIJI purchases; no exchange service or payments are active here.</p></div></section><section class="r-info-row"><h2>Sharing safely</h2><div><p>Initially, exchange only identifiable charms, not worn posts or earring backs. Do not post addresses, phone numbers, IDs or payment details. Report concerns to the moderators.</p></div></section><section class="r-info-row"><h2>In preparation</h2><div><p>The exchange community is being prepared. Joining details will appear in your membership space when it opens.</p></div></section><section class="r-info-row"><h2>Joining when it opens</h2><div><p>Joining details and the applicable rules will be shared if the community opens. You can email us about your interest.</p></div></section><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/contact' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Contact SUIJI<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></div>
